## Scope of this license — what it does and does not cover

This licence (CC BY 4.0) covers Petra's own compilation, schema, and authored content in this file — the structure, the tier classification, and any Petra-authored summary text. It does NOT cover, and Petra does not license: the linked primary-source documents themselves (each "sources" entry links to its issuing authority's own material, which remains that authority's), third-party marks (destination authority names/marks are used descriptively, not as an endorsement), or quoted third-party source text reproduced for citation. Those remain their owners' property, under whatever terms the owner publishes them.

This is the exact `license_scope` text embedded in every record's own
`license_scope` field in this dataset (see `corridors/<slug>.json` and
`index.json`) — restated here so it is visible to anyone reading only this
file.

